<title>USA: SIOUX FALLS HOGS $1.00 OFF - USDA.</title>
<headline>SIOUX FALLS HOGS $1.00 OFF - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower. Trading moderately active. Top $55.25 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    220-260 lbs    55.00-55.25</p>
<p>	    260-270 lbs    54.50-55.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    270-280 lbs    53.50-54.50</p>
<p>	    280-290 lbs    52.50-53.50</p>
<p>US 3-4    290-300 lbs    51.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows 300-450 lbs 0.75-1.00 lower; 450-500 lbs no comparison due to limited supplies yesterday;  500-650 lbs 1.00 lower. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-450 lbs    45.00-45.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    46.00</p>
<p>	    500-650 lbs    47.00-49.00</p>
</text>
